命令执行；不要与 cd、检查命令或彼此用 &&、分号、管道、换行、变量赋值或重定向拼接。git status、git diff、测试和 git rev-parse 另行执行。两条 Git 前缀 allow 规则只授权对应命令；若独立执行仍被沙箱拒绝，上报问题并结束，不重试或修改权限。\n完成并 Git 提交后，把 FULL_COMMIT_SHA 换成完整提交号，运行以下 CLI 显式交付：\n'/opt/homebrew/Cellar/node/26.5.0/bin/node' '/Volumes/WD-Elements/a2a-workbench/t082-boundary-g8eihosi/readonly-argv/workbench/src/gates/cli.ts' '--state' '/Volumes/WD-Elements/a2a-workbench/q76-k3d58xtx/c-dbrbfgl0/state' 'submit' '--task' 'fixture-20261016-1' '--attempt' '0e92817a-34ac-45c6-88de-0448554c5ee0' '--session' '6e55be83-7735-4f21-bc13-591800d57232' '--fence' '1' '--spec-rev' '1' '--commit' 'FULL_COMMIT_SHA'\n本会话的 CLI 会将 submit、status、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。"}},{"seq":27,"time":"2026-10-16T08:21:37.937Z","task":"fixture-20261016-1","attempt":"0e92817a-34ac-45c6-88de-0448554c5ee0","type":"dispatched","details":{"attempt":{"task_id":"fixture-20261016-1","attempt_id":"0e92817a-34ac-45c6-88de-0448554c5ee0","session_id":"6e55be83-7735-4f21-bc13-591800d57232","fence":1,"spec_rev":1,"thread_id":"7f82d92f-e9d4-40eb-97be-72b8fcbd6471","runtime_mode":"workspace-write","turn_id":null,"runtime_identity":{"launch":"9489a279-4eef-4a26-8fcd-0cf9ef7b8fda","thread":"7f82d92f-e9d4-40eb-97be-72b8fcbd6471","shell_pid":31000,"leader_pid":31001,"native_session":"fixture-native-9489a279-4eef-4a26-8fcd-0cf9ef7b8fda"},"workspace":"/Volumes/WD-Elements/a2a-workbench/q76-k3d58xtx/c-dbrbfgl0/state/worktrees/fixture/fixture-20261016-1-a1","base_commit":"4f8b921365995312031fb68c882f1764cf618534","card_snapshot_id":"2bdea62a-b9d5-488f-aced-d6343dc74ece","reclaimed":false,"owner":"fixture-20261016-1","state":"claimed"}}},{"seq":28,"time":"2026-10-16T08:21:39.150Z","task":"fixture-20261016-1","attempt":"0e92817a-34ac-45c6-88de-0448554c5ee0","type":"command_intent","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/Volumes/